<title>RUSSIA: Russia RTS index closes up 1.5 pct at record.</title>
<headline>Russia RTS index closes up 1.5 pct at record.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Trading System index of 22 leading shares rose 1.5 pct on Tuesday to close at a record 526.20, after 518.31 previously, on robust total market turnover of $67.5 million.</p>
<p>The previous closing record was set on July 29, when the index rose to 517.54.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
